  "hokusai_content_check": "Volume 5 (hokusaimangav5kats): all 35 scan images (indices 0-34) were viewed one by one on numbered contact sheets (--contact-sheets); plates 9, 21 and 27, which show figures in loincloths, were also viewed enlarged. Contents: front and back cover (0, 34), front matter and title pages (1, 2), deity and court portraits (3, 18-20, 24, 25, 28, 29), shrine gates, bells, temple roofs and buildings (4-8, 11-17), guardian demons and a priest (9, 10), wrestlers (21), Mount Fuji and waves (23, 26), a hungry-ghost demon (27) and the publisher's catalogue (30-33). No nude figures and no bawdy or erotic plates were found, so volume 5 is used with no pages left out.",
